    "detailed_description": "\ud83d\udd25 Only Whores Survive \ud83d\udd1e \u2014 Survival\u2019s never been this damn sexy.<br><br>The world\u2019s gone to hell. Zombies roam the streets, bandits loot every corner, and chaos rules. But there\u2019s one guy who isn\u2019t just surviving \u2014 he\u2019s hunting. Meet Pawel Roko, the last badass standing, and the only hope for the lost \u2014 and super hot \u2014 girls left behind.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748790/extras/9a8d1c227b6106f7d9bf410938cfef5d.poster.avif?t=1749380518\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748790/extras/9a8d1c227b6106f7d9bf410938cfef5d.webm?t=1749380518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748790/extras/9a8d1c227b6106f7d9bf410938cfef5d.mp4?t=1749380518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83c\udfaf Survive. Rescue. Enjoy.<br>You\u2019ve got a limited number of days to clean up the zone, save as many babes as you can, and stay alive. Each girl you rescue brings her own story, her own charm\u2026 and her own way of saying \u201cthanks\u201d \ud83d\ude0f.<br><br>\ud83d\udd2b Third-person shooter action. Loot hard, fight harder.<br>Lock and load in thrilling third-person combat. Blast your way through hordes of zombies, collect crates packed with weapons, ammo, modules, and gear \u2014 before rival scavengers grab them first.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748790/extras/7868eb177ec6618c7c182e5bbb4a4450.poster.avif?t=1749380518\" width=600 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748790/extras/7868eb177ec6618c7c182e5bbb4a4450.webm?t=1749380518\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3748790/extras/7868eb177ec6618c7c182e5bbb4a4450.mp4?t=1749380518\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>\ud83d\udce1 Link up with HQ.<br>Once you fix the comms, the zombie response team will drop supplies and support. But until then? You\u2019re on your own, soldier \u2014 just you, your gear, and the girls you save.<br><br>\ud83e\udddf\u200d\u2640\ufe0f Only the hottest survive.<br>This isn\u2019t your grandma\u2019s apocalypse. It\u2019s brutal, dirty, and dripping with twisted pleasure. Can you hold the line and turn the end of the world into your own wild harem adventure?<br><br>\ud83d\udd1e ADULT-ONLY CONTENT.<br>Packed with explicit scenes, steamy rewards, and a full harem relationship system. Only for adults. Only for the brave. This is third-person survival... with benefits.",
